      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "USE OF PROCEEDS We estimate the net proceeds to us from the offering\nto be approximately $\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 billion, after deducting the underwriting discounts and estimated offering expenses payable by us. We intend to\nuse the net proceeds from the offering to repay short-term debt and for other general corporate purposes. At September\u00a030, 2026,\nour outstanding short-term debt of $1.4 billion had a weighted average interest rate of 4.20% and an average life of less than 30 days. Pending disposition, we may temporarily invest\nthe net proceeds of the offering not required immediately for the intended purposes in U.S. governmental securities and other high quality\nU.S. securities. Field: Page; Sequence: 15; Value: 1 S- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo 13 Field: /Sequence Field: /Page CAPITALIZATION The table below shows our consolidated capitalization\nstructure on an actual basis. As of Se",
